          "guidance": "UMN describes onion maggot feeding as a cause of yellowing and wilt and lists Fusarium basal rot, Botrytis neck rot and bacterial soft rot among onion problems. These signs require diagnosis; the record does not imply red onions are more susceptible or resistant than other color classes.",
