          "guidance": "UMN Extension recommends a sunny site with deep, rich, moist loam; hard, shallow or stony soil can produce malformed roots and lower yields. Its soil preparation and row spacing are Minnesota garden guidance, not hydroponic parameters or pod spacing. No indoor light, EC or pH target is established.",
